{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNHeatmapStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" instances in an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNHeatmapStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNHeatmapStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" object."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Consider accompanying a heatmap style layer with an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNHeatmapStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNHeatmapStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" at high zoom levels. If you are unsure whether the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"point data in an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNHeatmapStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" is dense enough to warrant a heatmap,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you can alternatively cluster the source using the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNHeatmapStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"option and render the data using an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNHeatmapStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNHeatmapStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineCont